{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は明日の\nマンモスフリーマーケットの\nリハでしたー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみすぎるっっっ\nらりんうるさかったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんちゃんかわいいっ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイテンション！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてったって明日は...にや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日早いから頑張って起きよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緑って、濃いのと薄いの\nどっちの方が好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他はどんな色が好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はクラシックな深緑とか\n明るめの王道緑！がすきかな。\nあと、きれいな黄緑とか！\nカーキとはちょっと違うよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生は帰宅部だったの？\n何もしてなかったの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入ってなかった代わりに\nバレエずっと習ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男の人の髪型は\nどんなのがタイプかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナチュラル！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷え性対策って\nどんな感じでしてる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生姜いっぱい摂るようにしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"編み物できんの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーと...編めません。\nママに教えてもらう予定←\nでも編む以外にも何か作れるから、\n作ったら載せます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に似合う色って\nどうやって見つけたらいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もわからないから\n好きな色を好きなだけ着てる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタさんはいるって\nいつまで信じてた？(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生までかなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠足の思い出とかありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠足のしおりの表紙とか\n描いてたなぁー...\nお菓子は500円まで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、友達に\n「服装がロックだねぇ」って\n言われたのを覚えている。遠足で。\n遠足らしい話じゃなくて\nすみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい、今日食べ過ぎた～って\nときはどうすればいい？(> <)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運動とかマッサージする！\nなかなか我慢できないよね。\n私も今日は食べ過ぎた;("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色に例えると何色と\n言われたことある？\nもしくは自分は何色やと思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクとかオレンジとか\n緑っていろいろ言われる。\n全然わからない。なんでだろう。\n私って何色なんだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔の筋肉やわらかいの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！たぶん♪←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼久しぶりに私服！／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ZARAの赤のカーディガン\nママにもらった茶色のブーツ。\nあ、また同じおじパンや！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まーりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんず"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/17/8044125/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}